+# Defer an OPEN claim until a date after the sheet's today. Until the sheet's today reaches that date the claim counts in no total, is not overdue, cannot be settled and is left unbound by a statement. A refused deferral (not OPEN, a date not after today, unknown claim, a claim dated in a closed period) writes nothing, not even an audit line.
